{"resourceIdentifier":"3901","resourceName":"Anhua LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Anhua LFG Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the project) is located at Anhua MSW Landfill, Yanzhu village, Dongping Town, Anhua County, Yiyang City, Hunan province, P.R China. The purpose of the project is to utilize landfill gas (LFG), which consists mainly of methane, for electricity generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system, flaring and electricity generation system. LFG collected will be used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators. The total installed capacity will be 3 MW included four generators with each 0.5 MW and one generator with 1 MW.\r\nIn absence of the project, equivalent amount of electricity exported to the grid by the project would have otherwise been supplied by CCPG. Greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions will be reduced by avoiding CO2 emissions from those fossil fuel-based power plants connected to the grid and by avoiding GHG emissions from releasing LFG into atmosphere at the landfill site.","location":{"latitude":28.397555,"longitude":111.266610},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-17","endExclusive":"2022-12-18","endInclusive":"2022-12-17"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3901"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hunan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Anhua Yuanjing Environmental Protection Technology Co. LtD."},{"type":"string","value":"Hunan province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3901"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"97392"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}